      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "Half of this is done, and friend names are yellow again on nameplates. \n\nThe \"In Instance\" menu is a separate case: we kept the yellow name treatment to nameplates on purpose rather than pushing it across every menu surface. \n\nFor lists like In Instance we're looking at other ways to make friends obvious, like grouping them into their own section and making the friend icon more visible.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
